  "notes": "{贈|おく}る means to give something as a gift or to present/bestow.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {花|はな}を{贈|おく}る: to give flowers\n- プレゼントを{贈|おく}る: to give a present\n- {言葉|ことば}を{贈|おく}る: to give words (of encouragement/blessing)\n- {賞|しょう}を{贈|おく}る: to award a prize\n- {称号|しょうごう}を{贈|おく}る: to bestow a title\n\nDIFFERENCE FROM {送|おく}る:\n- {贈|おく}る: to give as a gift, to present (formal, ceremonial)\n- {送|おく}る: to send, to see off (physical movement)\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: Transitive ({他動詞|たどうし})\n- Pattern: 〜に〜を{贈|おく}る",
